hadiths[52]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2875","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne ek lashkar bheja jo bahut se faujiyon se mazboot tha."
"2876","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \apnay ghrwn kw qbrstan nh bnnay dyay۔ bay shk shytan as ghr myn dakhl nhyn hwta jhan swr albqrh prhy jayay۔\"""""""
"2877","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Har cheez ki ek hump (sar bulandi) hoti hai aur Quran ki hump (sar bulandi) Surah Al-Baqarah hai.\"""""""
"2878","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jis ne Ha Mim Al-Mu'min — se lekar — To Him is the return (40:1-3) aur Ayat Al-Kursi subah ke waqt padh li"
"2879","Al-Qasim ibn Dinar al-Kufi ne hum se rivayat kiya, Mus'ab ibn al-Miqdam ne al-Hasan ibn Salih se, Layth ibn Abi Sulaym se, Tawus se, Jabir se, ke Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: ""Jo Allah aur akhiraat ke din par iman rakhta ho, wo baghair izar (tehband/lungi) ke hammam (ghar) na jaye. Aur jo Allah aur akhiraat ke din par iman rakhta ho, wo apni biwi ko hammam na jane de. Aur jo Allah aur akhiraat ke din par iman rakhta ho, wo aisi maiz (dastarkhwan) par na baith jahan sharab ghumai ja rahi ho."" Abu Isa ne farmaya: Ye hadith hasan gharib hai, hum Tawus se Jabir se isay sirf isi tareeq se jante hain. Muhammad ibn Ismail ne farmaya: Layth ibn Abi Sulaym saduq hain magar kabhi kabhi bhool bhi jaate hain. Muhammad ibn Ismail ne farmaya: Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne kaha: Layth ke hadith se khushi nahi hoti, Layth aisi cheezein rafa' karta tha jo ghair nahi karta tha, isliye unhe za'if qarar diya gaya."
"2880","Abu Mas'ud Al-Ansari (رضي الله عنho) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs raat ke aakhri do aayat Surah Al-Baqarah padh le"
"2881","Nuqta-e-Nu'man bin Bashir (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai ke Nabi-e-Akram (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne doo hazaar saal pehle"
"2882","Hazrat An-Nawwas bin Sam'an (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Quran Majid aaega...\"""""""
"2883","Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rzy allh anh) ky rwayt hay: \allh taalyٰ nay aasmanwn awr zmyn myn aayt alkrsy say zyadh azym kwyy chyz nhyn pyda ky hay۔\"" sfyan nay kha: \""kywnkh aayt alkrsy allh taalyٰ ka klam hay۔\"""""""
"2884","Abu Ishaq ne riwayat ki ke unhon ne Al-Bara (رضي الله عنه) se suna ke: \Ek aisa waqt tha jab ek shakhs Surah Al-Kahf tilawat kar raha tha"
"2885","Abu Darda (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs swrh alkhf ky tyn aayat prhay tw wh djal kay ftnay say mhfwz rhay ga۔\"""""""
"2886","Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak har cheez ka ek dil hota hai.\"""""""
"2887","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs raat ko Ha Mim Ad-Dukhan padhe"
"2888","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs jmah ky rat myn hm aldkhan prhay"""""
"2889","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay:\n\nnby krym (ﷺ) kay ayk shaby nay ayk qbr pr khymh lgaya، asay yh malwm nhyn tha kh wh qbr hay۔ achank asay qbr myn say ayk shkhs ky aawaz snayy dy jw swrhٰ almlk prh rha tha yhan tk kh as nay asay mkml kr lya۔ phr wh nby krym (ﷺ) kay pas aayay awr kha: \ya rswl allh!\"""""""
"2890","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak Quran Majeed mein ek Surah hai jo teenz aayat ki hai.\"""""""
"2891","Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiḥ: Rasool (ﷺ) na tab na so jaate jab tak woh Alif Lam Mim Tanzil aur Tabarak Alladhi Biyadihil-Muk (Surah Al-Mulk) tilawat na karna chuka jaate. Yeh hadith Laith bin Abi Sulaim se ek se ziyaada rawaat ne isi tarah riwayat ki. Mughirah bin Muslim ne Abu Az-Zubair se yeh riwayat ki."
"2892","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) se rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs swrh aza zlzlt (swrh alzlzlh) prhay...\"""""""
"2893","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Idha Zulzilat Qur'an ka aadha barabar hai.\"""""""
"2894","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay apnay shabh myn say ayk shkhs say frmaya: \kya tm nay flaany say shady kr ly؟\"" as nay kha: \""allh ky qsm! nhyn، aay rswl allh! awr myray pas shady kay lyay kchh nhyn hay۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""kya tm nhyn jantay: 'qlْ wَ allُ hdٌ'؟\"" as nay kha: \""zrwr janta hwn۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""yh qraan ka ayk thayy hay۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""kya tm nhyn jantay: 'za jaaَ nsrُ allِ walfthُ'؟\"" as nay kha: \""zrwr janta hwn۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""yh qraan ka ayk chwthayy hay۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""kya tm nhyn jantay: 'qlْ a a alafrwnَ'؟\"" as nay kha: \""zrwr janta hwn۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""yh qraan ka ayk chwthayy hay۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""kya tm nhyn jantay: 'za zlzltِ alrzُ'؟\"" as nay kha: \""zrwr janta hwn۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""yh qraan ka ayk chwthayy hay۔\"" aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""shady kr lw۔\"""""""
"2895","Abu Ayyub (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \kya tm myn say kwyy shkhs ayk rat myn qraan ka thayy hsh prhna chahta hay؟ jw shkhs allh alsmd prhay tw as nay qraan ka thayy hsh prh lya۔\"""""""
"2896","Abu Horaira (رضي الله عنه) rivayat karte hain: Main Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath nikla aur ek shakhs \Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad\"" (Allahus-Samad) tilawat kar raha tha. Tab Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Yeh wajib hai.\"" Maine pucha: \""Wajib kya hai?\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne faramaaya: \""Behesht.\"""""""
"2897","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jo shakhs rozana do sau martaba *Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad* padhe...\"""""""
"2898","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad Quran-e-Majeed ka tihai hissa hai.\"""""""
"2899","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jama ho jao"
"2900","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay: ansar myn ayk shkhs jw msjd qba myn an ky nmaz ky amamt krta tha۔ jb bhy wh nmaz myn kwyy swrt prhnay ka aradh krta"
"2901","Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir Al-Juhani (Razi Allah unhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Mujh par kuch aayat nazil hain jaisi pehle kabhi nahi dekhi gayi hain: 'Qul A'udhu Birabbin-Nas' se lekar Surah ke ant tak aur 'Qul A'udhu Birabbil-Falaq' se lekar Surah ke ant tak.\"""""""
"2902","Uqbah bin 'Amir (rzy allh anh) ky rwayt kay mtabq: rswl allh (ﷺ) nay mjhay hr nmaz kay aakhr myn almwaztyn ka tlawt krnay ka hkm dya۔"
"2903","Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) nay rwayt ky kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs qraan krym ka tlawt kray awr as myn mhart rkhta wh"""""
"2904","Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (rzy all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs qraan mjyd ky tlawt kray awr asay hfz kr lay۔"""""
"2905","Hazrat Haarith Al-A'war (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke main Masjid se guzra jab log qissa-goi mein mashghool thay. Main Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anke) ke paas aaya aur kiya: \Ameer-ul-Momineen! Kya aap nahi dekh ke log qissa-goi mein masruf ho rahe hain?\"""" Unhon ne farmaya: \""""Kya unhein is mein ghalti kar di gayi hai?\"""" Maine kaha: \""""Ji haan.\"""" Unhon ne farmaya: \""""Jabke main...\"""""""""""""
"2906","Abu Abdur-Rahman (rhmh allh) nay hzrt asman bn afan (rzy allh anh) say rwayt ky kh rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \tm myn say bhtryn wh hay jw qraan sykhay awr skhayay۔\"" abwabdalrhmn (rhmh allh) nay kha: \""asy lyay myn apny as jgh bytha hwa hwn۔\"" awr anhwn nay hzrt asman (rzy allh anh) kay zmanay myn qraan skhaya yhan tk kh hjaj bn ywsf aaya۔ (shyh)"""""
"2907","Uthman (bin Affan) (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Tum mein sab se behtar — ya tum mein sab se afzal — woh hai jo Quran seekhaye aur usse sikhaye.\"""""""
"2908","Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Tum mein se behtar woh hai jo Quran-e-Majeed seekhaye aur usse sikhaye.\"""""""
"2909","Narrated Muhammad bin Ka'b Al-Qurazi: \n\Maine Abdullah bin Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) ko suna keh rahe the: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs Allah ki Kitab (Quran) mein se ek harf padhe...'\"""""""
"2910","Hammād ibn Zayd ne riwāyat ki ke unho ne kahā ke hamein Muhammad ibn ʿAbd al-Malik ibn Abī al-Shawārib ne riwāyat ki, unho ne kahā ke hamein Abū ʿAwānah ne riwāyat ki, unho ne kahā ke hamein Abū ʿUthmān ne riwāyat ki, jo unke ek mashāyikh mein se the, unho ne Anas رضي الله عنه se riwāyat ki ke Nabī ﷺ ne un se farmāyā: \Ai mere chhote bete.\""\n\nIs bāb mein al-Mughīrah aur ʿUmar ibn Abī Salamah رضي الله عنهما se bhi riwāyāt hain.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā (al-Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: Yeh is silsile se ḥasan ṣaḥīh gharīb hadith hai. Is ke alāwā Anas رضي الله عنه se is hadith ko dusre turuq se bhi riwāyat kī gaʾī hai. Yeh Abū ʿUthmān ek muʿtamad shaykh hain; woh al-Jaʿd ibn ʿUthmān hain"
"2911","Jubair bin Nufair (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Tum Allah (سبحانه و تعالی) ke saamne us cheez se zyada neik cheez ke saath wapas nahi aaoge jo uski taraf se aayi hani.\"" Yani Quran Kareem."""""
"2912","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya ke: \Beshak...\"""""""
"2913","Abdullah bin Amr (razi Allahu anhu) se riwayat hain ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Quran-e-Majeed ko yaad karne wale se kaha jayega"
"2914","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Nabi-e-Akram (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Quran-e-Majeed ko yaad karne wala Qayamat ke din aayega aur (Quran tilawat ka sawaal) kahega: 'Aey Mubarakbad! Ussay zeenat ata farma.' Toh uss par sharaf ka taj pehna diya jayega. Phir woh kahega: 'Aey Mubarakbad! Aur zyada ata farma.' Toh uss par sharaf ka libaas pehna diya jayega. Phir woh kahega: 'Aey Mubarakbad! Uss se razi ho jaa.' Toh Allah Ta'ala uss se razi ho jayega aur farmayega: 'Padh aur aage barh.'\"""""""
"2915","Riwayat: Al-Muttalib bin Abdullah bin Hantab ne Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya:\n\n> *\Meri Ummat ke aamaal aur uske ajar-o-sawaab mere saamne pesh kiye gaye...\""""*"
"2916","Al-Hasan (رحمہ اللہ) سے روایت ہے کہ عمران بن حصین (رضی اللہ عنہ) ایک قاری کے پاس سے گزرے جو قرآن مجید کی تلاوت کر رہا تھا، پھر اس نے مانگنا شروع کر دیا۔ تو انہوں نے کہا: \بیشک ہم اللہ کے لیے ہیں اور اسی کی طرف لوٹ کر جائیں گے\"""" (انا للہ و انا الیہ راجعون)۔ پھر فرمایا: \""""میں نے رسول اللہ ﷺ کو فرماتے سنا ہے: جو شخص قرآن مجید کی تلاوت کرے...\""""\n\n\n\n*Note: Hadees yahan par qissat ke aagaz mein mukammal nahi hui hai — yeh is ka aagaz ka hissa hai. Aap poori hadees ka tarjuma chahte hain toh poora text bhej dein.*"""""""""
"2917","Suhaib (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs qraan myn hram chyzwn kw hlal smjhay، wh qraan pr ayman nhyn rkhta۔\"""""""
"2918","Uqbah bin 'Amir (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs qraan pblk twr pr tlawt krta hay، wh asay mannd hay jw sdqh alanyh twr pr dyta hay۔\"""""""
"2919","Hazrat Aisha (R.A.) se riwayat hai: \Hazrat Muhammad (ﷺ) Sura Bani Isra'il aur Sura Zumar tilawat farma ke so nahi sakte the.\"""""""
"2920","Irbad bin Sariyah (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) Musabbihat (yani woh suratein jo Subhan Allah, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi, SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azeem, SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi SubhanAllahil Azee