"2921","Ma'qil bin Yasar (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby akrm ﷺ nay frmaya: \n\jw shkhs sbh kay wqt tyn mrtbh yh khay: \nawzُ ballِ alsmaِ alalmِ mnَ alshtanِ alrjmِ \nawr swrh alhshr ky aakhry tyn aayat prhay — tw allh taalyٰ as kay lyay str hzar frshtay mqrr frma dyta hay jw sham tk as pr drwd bhyjtay rhtay hyn۔ awr agr as dn wh fwt hw jayay tw wh shhyd kay drjay pr hwga۔\"""""""
"2922","Hammam ibn Munabbih ne riwayat farmaya ke Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha ke Yahya ibn Sa'id al-Qattan ne riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha ke Fitr ibn Khalifah ne riwayat ki, mujhe Mundhir ath-Thawri ne riwayat ki, unhon ne Muhammad ibn al-Hanafiyyah se riwayat ki, aur unhon ne Ali ibn Abi Talib (radi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon ne farmaya: \Ya Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)"
"2923","Abdullah bin Abi Qais (Rizwanullahi Alaih) ne riwayat ki ke maine Aisha Siddiqa (Radi Allahu Anha) se Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke Witr ke baare mein poocha."
"2924","Jabir bin 'Abdullah (rzy allh anh) kay rwayt krdh hdys:\n\hj kay mwsm myn hazry kay mwqa pr...\"""""""
"2925","Hazrat Aisha (Allah us se razi ho) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein Hassan (radiallahu anhu) ke liye ek mimbar lagwate the, jis par wo khade hokar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf se fakr karte the — ya unhon ne kaha ke \Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki himayat karte the.\"" Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate the: \""Beshak Allah ta'ala Hassan ki Ruh al-Qudus ke saath madad farma raha hai jab tak wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasllam) ki taraf se fakr ya himayat karta rahe.\"""""""
"2926","Ibn Abi Mulaikah ne riwayat ki ke Umm Salamah (رضي الله عنها) ne farmaya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) tilawat mein waqt karte the"
